{#- Example dialogue, name-labelled. The retired message_examples.j2
    concatenated these with no name attached, so a SillyTavern-style card whose
    samples lean on {{char}} and unattributed narration was attributed by
    guesswork -- which is a large part of why a cast reads as interchangeable.

    Its own heading, for the reason voice_anchors.j2 gives.

    Vars: cast_blocks. -#}
{%- set blocks = [] -%}
{%- for b in cast_blocks -%}
{%- if b.name and b.example -%}
{%- set _ = blocks.append("## " ~ b.name ~ "
" ~ b.example) -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- if blocks %}# Voice — example dialogue

{{ blocks | join("

") }}
{%- endif -%}
